  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Given two arrays AAA and BBB each of length NNN.\n\nFind the value ∑i=1N∑j=1Nmax⁡(Ai⊕Bj,Ai&amp;Bj)\\sum_{i=1}^N\\sum_{j=1}^N \\max(A_i\\oplus B_j,A_i\\&amp; B_j)∑i=1N​∑j=1N​max(Ai​⊕Bj​,Ai​&amp;Bj​).\n\nHere ⊕\\oplus⊕ and &amp;\\&amp;&amp; denote the bitwise XOR operation and bitwise AND operation respectively.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input contains a single integer TTT - the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains an integer NNN - the length of arrays AAA and BBB.\nThe second line of each test case contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1,A_2,…,A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​ representing the array AAA.\nThe third line of each test case contains NNN space-separated integers B1,B2,…,BNB_1,B_2,…,B_NB1​,B2​,…,BN​ representing the array BBB.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output the value ∑i=1N∑j=1Nmax⁡(Ai⊕Bj,Ai&amp;Bj)\\sum_{i=1}^N\\sum_{j=1}^N \\max(A_i\\oplus B_j,A_i\\&amp; B_j)∑i=1N​∑j=1N​max(Ai​⊕Bj​,Ai​&amp;Bj​).",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\leq T \\leq 10^51≤T≤105",
      "1≤N≤1051 \\leq N \\leq 10^51≤N≤105",
      "0≤Ai,Bi&lt;2200 \\leq A_i, B_i \\lt 2^{20}0≤Ai​,Bi​&lt;220",
      "Sum of NNN does not exceed 2⋅1052\\cdot 10^52⋅105 over all test cases."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n2\n3 4\n1 2\n1\n0\n0\n3\n2 4 3\n1 2 1",
        "output": "15\n0\n30",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 111: For the given arrays, the value is: max⁡(3⊕1,3&1)+max⁡(3⊕2,3&2)+max⁡(4⊕1,4&1)+max⁡(4⊕2,4&2)=2+2+5+6=15\\max(3\\oplus 1,3\\& 1) + \\max(3\\oplus 2,3\\& 2) + \\max(4\\oplus 1,4\\& 1) + \\max(4\\oplus 2,4\\& 2) = 2 + 2 + 5 + 6 = 15max(3⊕1,3&1)+max(3⊕2,3&2)+max(4⊕1,4&1)+max(4⊕2,4&2)=2+2+5+6=15.\n\n\nTest Case 222: For the given arrays, the value is: max⁡(0⊕0,0&0)=0\\max(0\\oplus 0,0\\& 0) = 0max(0⊕0,0&0)=0.\n\n\nTest Case 333: For the given arrays, the value is: max⁡(2⊕1,2&1)+max⁡(2⊕2,2&2)+max⁡(2⊕1,2&1)+max⁡(4⊕1,4&1)+max⁡(4⊕2,4&2)+max⁡(4⊕1,4&1)+max⁡(3⊕1,3&1)+max⁡(3⊕2,3&2)+max⁡(3⊕1,3&1)\\max(2\\oplus 1,2\\& 1) + \\max(2\\oplus 2,2\\& 2) + \\max(2\\oplus 1,2\\& 1) + \\max(4\\oplus 1,4\\& 1) + \\max(4\\oplus 2,4\\& 2) + \\max(4\\oplus 1,4\\& 1) + \\max(3\\oplus 1,3\\& 1) + \\max(3\\oplus 2,3\\& 2) + \\max(3\\oplus 1,3\\& 1)max(2⊕1,2&1)+max(2⊕2,2&2)+max(2⊕1,2&1)+max(4⊕1,4&1)+max(4⊕2,4&2)+max(4⊕1,4&1)+max(3⊕1,3&1)+max(3⊕2,3&2)+max(3⊕1,3&1)\n=3+2+3+5+6+5+2+2+2=30= 3 + 2 + 3 + 5 + 6 + 5 + 2 + 2 + 2 = 30=3+2+3+5+6+5+2+2+2=30."
      }
    ]
  },
